# Finishes the run, or fails it.
#
# Each element script records itself in {xiaojie::selftest::done::*} once its detail line is in the
# log, so this stops the server as soon as they have all reported. Its second trigger is what turns a
# hung run into a failing one, and it uses no addon syntax, so it also runs when the addon is the
# thing that broke.
#
# The count has to match the number of files under `elements/`, which `serverTest` also lists. A
# mismatch is reported instead of hidden: fewer means an element never reported, more means the
# count here needs updating.

every 5 seconds:
    if size of {xiaojie::selftest::done::*} is 16:
        log "XIAOJIE_SELFTEST=PASS"
        stop the server

every 30 seconds:
    log "XIAOJIE_SELFTEST=FAIL the self-test did not finish: %size of {xiaojie::selftest::done::*}% of 16 elements reported"
    stop the server
